+ * FBIOPUT_VSCREENINFO / OMAPFB_SETUP_PLANE of the overlay.  Applies to every
+ * scaling overlay and only to upscaling (inc < 1024); downscaling is stock.
+ * Runtime: /sys/module/omapdss/parameters/scale_mode, boot: omapdss.scale_mode=
